# Extended regexes the secret scan (scripts/lib/gate.sh) cuts out of a line
# before it tries a pattern again: one per line, for values that look like a
# secret or an identifier but are not one. Say why above each.
# The four-part version pins in the template's own requirements files, whose
# names carry a Jinja condition.
^template/[^:]*requirements[^:]*:[0-9]+:[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+==[0-9.]+$
